WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.468
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)
-All right. Thank you very much.

00:00:02.468 --> 00:00:05.004
No, really, I appreciate that.
I know why you're excited.

00:00:05.138 --> 00:00:06.906
We're back on the air.
It's a new year.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.274
It's a leap year.
Did you know that?

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:10.076
It's a leap year,
we get one extra day.

00:00:10.209 --> 00:00:12.011
I thought-- I heard that today,
I thought, "Oh, that's great!"

00:00:12.145 --> 00:00:13.012
Then I remembered,

00:00:13.312 --> 00:00:15.481
"Oh, one more day
of Trump versus Biden.
Fuck, no."

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:17.917
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:21.020
-Thanks, but no thanks.
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:23.155
Yeah, I guess that,
that race is kind of over.

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:25.991
Trump won big in Iowa.
They had the Iowa caucus--

00:00:26.058 --> 00:00:27.593
They had it
on Martin Luther King Day.

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:29.462
-(LAUGHS)
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:31.464
What better way
to honor Martin Luther King

00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:32.932
than the Whitest state
in the nation,

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:35.568
voting for a guy
who's gonna take you back
to the 1950s.

00:00:35.768 --> 00:00:38.037
-The-- This is--
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:40.373
Well, I mean...
(CHUCKLES) ...come on.

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:45.211
Well, you saw, uh,
Nikki Haley came in third,

00:00:45.978 --> 00:00:48.648
you know, so... (LAUGHS)
...she's a... (LAUGHS)

00:00:48.781 --> 00:00:52.718
-...history buff Nikki, uh...
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:54.987
She said,
"This has never been
a racist country."

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:57.022
-Never?
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:00:57.156 --> 00:00:59.158
I mean, we can argue--
Um, "Never," really?

00:00:59.291 --> 00:01:01.494
I mean, this is someone
who goes by Nikki.

00:01:02.095 --> 00:01:04.396
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
-(LAUGHS)

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:05.998
Because she--
if used her real name,

00:01:06.131 --> 00:01:07.600
no one in her party
would vote for her.

00:01:07.733 --> 00:01:12.538
-But it's not... Uh...
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:01:12.905 --> 00:01:17.309
And, uh... the other
Indian-American in the race,

00:01:17.443 --> 00:01:19.078
Vivek Ramaswamy, he dropped out.

00:01:19.511 --> 00:01:20.713
Dropped out of the race
and admitted

00:01:20.846 --> 00:01:22.248
he is Sasha Baron Cohen.

00:01:22.381 --> 00:01:24.149
-So, that's--
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:01:24.283 --> 00:01:28.254
-I thought that. (LAUGHS)
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:32.725
Right, he was
the youngest candidate at 38.

00:01:32.859 --> 00:01:36.095
-Now, it's gonna be,
you know, 82 versus 78.
-(AUDIENCE CHUCKLING)

00:01:36.228 --> 00:01:38.898
The oldest... The oldest
combined number of years

00:01:39.031 --> 00:01:40.667
we've ever had running.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.768
Well, though Trump
was bragging this week,

00:01:42.968 --> 00:01:44.870
he said he feels
like a 35-year-old.

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:48.006
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
-He said this. (CHUCKLES)

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:49.709
He owes it
to his fitness routine.

00:01:49.842 --> 00:01:54.380
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-(CHUCKLES) Really.

00:01:57.483 --> 00:02:00.053
He says, every morning
he does 100 brain farts.

00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:01.054
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

